  "job_B9.5.5_20251003_115024": {
    "chunk_text": "\u00e6s hit upp alocen, to Eac swylce sum wer w\u00e6s swi\u00f0e arwyr\u00fees lifes, \u00feam w\u00e6s nama Constantius, se w\u00e6s \u00fe\u00e6re burge Se w\u00e6s niwan for\u00f0fered on \u00fea tid mines foregengan, se w\u00e6s eadigre gemynde papa Iohannes. Manige men cy\u00fedon, \u00fe\u00e6t he h\u00e6fde witedomes gast, \u00fea \u00fee hine cu\u00felice cu\u00f0on. Eac \u00fe\u00e6t secga\u00f0 \u00fea \u00e6f\u00e6stan & \u00fea so\u00f0sagalan weras, \u00fee him andwearda w\u00e6ron, betwyh o\u00ferum \u00dea se f\u00e6der \u00feurh witedomes gast him andswarode \u00feus cwe\u00feende: \u00e6fter me Constantie feh\u00f0 to Eala, \u00feu burh, \u00feu Equine, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00fee \u00feus gelimpe\u00f0. & \u00fea gecwedenum \u00feyses witedomes wordum he his gast ons\u00e6nde. & him \u00fea for\u00f0ferdum Andreas, se \u00fee \u00e6r w\u00e6s his deacon, he onfeng \u00fe\u00e6re heordelican scire & him \u00fea of \u00feysum life al\u00e6ddum, Iobinus w\u00e6s hleotende \u00fea \u00e6ndebyrdnysse biscophades, se w\u00e6s & him \u00fea gyt lifigendum swa \u00fea eardiend \u00fe\u00e6re ceastre wurdon forhergode ealle, & mid & swa w\u00e6s gefylled se cwyde \u00fe\u00e6s halgan weres, \u00fe\u00e6t \u00e6fter for\u00f0si\u00fee & \u00e6fter geleornesse \u00feara Eac ne forswigie ic na \u00feis, \u00fe\u00e6t gelamp nu for twam g\u00e6rum s\u00e6cgendum \u00feam arwyr\u00f0an were Witodlice he s\u00e6de, \u00fe\u00e6t in Lucan \u00fe\u00e6re c\u00e6stre, seo \u00fee him neh w\u00e6s, w\u00e6re sum wer swi\u00f0e \u00de\u00e6s wundra sum \u00fe\u00e6t m\u00e6reste w\u00e6",
